Licence of the image and of this repository
===========================================

The MIT licence below covers only the files of this repository: the
Dockerfile, the helper scripts, the tests and the documentation.

The Docker image built from it contains Maestro, which is licensed under the
WanGP Non-Commercial Evaluation License 1.1:
https://github.com/Blizaine/Maestro/blob/main/app/LICENSE.txt
The full text ships in the image at /opt/maestro/src/app/LICENSE.txt.

The image must not be used commercially. It may be used for your own,
non-commercial purposes only, or under a separate commercial licence from the
WanGP licensor. In particular it must not be run as a hosted service, an API
or part of a product for paying customers. The model weights Maestro downloads
carry their own licences.


